        "bottom": 451.49
      },
      "reading_order": 69,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP001:p0057:b0070",
      "text": "Vibration Limits Resources",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 89.998,
        "top": 440.49,
        "x1": 232.228,
        "bottom": 451.49
      },
      "reading_order": 70,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP001:p0057:b0071",
      "text": "References to selected condition monitoring and vibration measurement standards are listed. ISO standards",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 89.995,
        "top": 456.247,
        "x1": 541.348,
        "bottom": 466.747
      },
      "reading_order": 71,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP001:p0057:b0072",
      "text": "are listed by subcommittee topic for ease of reference. These standards are applicable to some of the",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 89.995,
        "top": 468.247,
        "x1": 541.411,
        "bottom": 478.747
      },
      "reading_order": 72,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP001:p0057:b0073",
      "text": "techniques listed in this Section. As these standards are periodically revised or superseded, users of a",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 90.001,
        "top": 480.247,
        "x1": 541.28,
        "bottom": 490.747
      },
      "reading_order": 73,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP001:p0057:b0074",
      "text": "standard should check the International Standards Organization’s web site (www.iso.org) to verify if the",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 89.996,
        "top": 492.247,
        "x1": 541.255,
        "bottom": 502.747
      },
      "reading_order": 74,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP001:p0057:b0075",
      "text": "listed standard is current.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 90.002,
        "top": 504.247,
        "x1": 195.569,
        "bottom": 514.747
      },
      "reading_order": 75,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP001:p0057:b0076",
      "text": "2.7.1 Mechanical Vibration, Shock, and Condition Monitoring",
      "bbox": {
